Date: REGEX(.*)
Fiware-Correlator: REGEX([0-9a-f\-]{36})
Location: /v2/subscriptions/REGEX([0-9a-f]{24})
Content-Length: 0



03. Create custom sub (for F/T) with contextReferences E2/T2 using text payload
===============================================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Fiware-Correlator: REGEX([0-9a-f\-]{36})
Location: /v2/subscriptions/REGEX([0-9a-f]{24})
Content-Length: 0



04. Create entity E/T with attribute named contextReferences
============================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Fiware-Correlator: REGEX([0-9a-f\-]{36})
Location: /v2/entities/E?type=T
Content-Length: 0



05. Create entity F/T with A=0
==============================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Fiware-Correlator: REGEX([0-9a-f\-]{36})
Location: /v2/entities/F?type=T
Content-Length: 0



06. Dump accumulator and see two notifications
==============================================
POST http://127.0.0.1:REGEX(\d+)/notify?refA=1
Fiware-Servicepath: /
Content-Length: 176
User-Agent: orion/REGEX(\d+\.\d+\.\d+.*)
Ngsiv2-Attrsformat: normalized
Host: 127.0.0.1:REGEX(\d+)
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Fiware-Correlator: REGEX([0-9a-f\-]{36}); cbnotif=1
X-Ref-B: foo

{
    "data": [
        {
            "id": "E",
            "refA": {
                "metadata": {},
                "type": "Number",
                "value": 1
            },
            "refB": {
                "metadata": {},
                "type": "Text",
                "value": "foo"
            },
            "type": "T"
        }
    ],
    "subscriptionId": "REGEX([0-9a-f]{24})"
}
=======================================
POST http://127.0.0.1:REGEX(\d+)/notify
Fiware-Servicepath: /
Content-Length: 2
User-Agent: orion/REGEX(\d+\.\d+\.\d+.*)
Ngsiv2-Attrsformat: custom
Host: 127.0.0.1:REGEX(\d+)
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: text/plain
Fiware-Correlator: REGEX([0-9a-f\-]{36}); cbnotif=1

11
=======================================


--TEARDOWN--
brokerStop CB
dbDrop CB
accumulatorStop
